4. EMBEDDED REFERENCE DATA

The electricity and fuel price tables (evprices.js, FUEL_HIST in i18n-adjacent
data files) are derived from published statistics of public bodies. Each entry
carries its issuing source and year in the code itself — see the KWH_SRC and
FUEL_HIST_SRC tables — and those sources retain whatever rights apply to their
own publications. The selection, arrangement, and verification of these tables
are the copyright holder's work and fall under Section 1.


